["Conveyor", "Factory", "Chaos", "Maze", "Fix"], "long_description": "Can You Handle the Ultimate Assembly Line Madness?\n\nStep onto the factory floor and prepare for pure puzzle frantic fun! In Conveyor Chaos, you are the master of the machinery, tasked with keeping a high-speed bottling line from turning into a total disaster. Bottles of various colors are rapidly moving down the line, and only your quick thinking can guide them to the right destination.\n\nThe tracks are broken, the speed is turning up, and the bottles just keep coming! You\u2019ll need to think steps ahead\u2014rotating conveyor tracks, switching lanes, and solving spatial puzzles in real-time. One wrong move or a missed connection, and it\u2019s game over for production!\n\nKey Features:\n\nFast-Paced VR Puzzle Action: Experience the thrill of managing a live, moving production line directly in Virtual Reality.\n\nDynamic Track Shifting: Rotate and realign conveyor paths on the fly to create a perfect route for the incoming bottles.\n\nVibrant Color Sorting: Match the bottles to their designated packing zones as the chaos intensifies.\n\nTest Your Reflexes & Logic: A perfect blend of quick reflexes and puzzle-solving strategy that keeps you on your toes.\n\nEscalating Challenges: Face increasingly complex factory layouts with multiple lanes, faster speeds, and ultimate chaotic puzzles.\n\nGrab your controllers, take control of the grid, and see if you have what it takes to beat the chaos!", "short_description": "Manage the madness! Guide colored bottles through a chaotic conveyor belt maze. Shift lanes, fix tracks, and save the factory from total breakdown!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Broken Engineers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST